window.CJV_DATA = {"script":{"title":{"zh":"CoffeeJeV · 三分钟看懂","en":"CoffeeJeV · a three minute tour"},"voices":{"zh":"zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural","en":"en-US-AriaNeural"},"rate":{"zh":"-6%","en":"-4%"},"fps":30,"leadIn":1.2,"gapAfter":1.0,"scenes":[{"id":"01","minDur":11,"kicker":{"zh":"开场","en":"THE PROBLEM"},"title":{"zh":"九成的判断，仍然靠走一圈","en":"Most decisions are still a walk and a guess"},"say":{"zh":"在咖啡育苗场，大部分决定还是靠一个人走过一排排苗架，看一眼，然后凭经验拍板。这不是不专业，只是还没有工具，把这双眼睛变成可以复用的判断。","en":"In a coffee nursery, most calls still come down to one person walking the rows, taking a look, and trusting their gut. That is not unprofessional. There simply has not been a tool that turns that eye into something reusable."}},{"id":"02","minDur":11,"kicker":{"zh":"这是什么","en":"WHAT IT IS"},"title":{"zh":"它不是一个聊天机器人","en":"It is not a chatbot"},"say":{"zh":"CoffeeJeV 是一个判断层。从一根芽到一袋可交付的豆子，一共十四个节点。每个节点只回答三件事：做什么决定，有多可信，要不要叫人。","en":"CoffeeJeV is a decision layer. From a single shoot to a delivered bag, there are fourteen checkpoints. Each one answers three things: what to do, how confident we are, and whether a human should be called in."}},{"id":"03","minDur":12,"kicker":{"zh":"设计评审","en":"WHAT CHANGED"},"title":{"zh":"第一版判得不错，但只停在判断","en":"The first draft judged well — and stopped there"},"say":{"zh":"上一版能说这盘污染了，却说不出该隔离哪三层架、哪批苗、哪条母株线。这一版补齐了四件事：批次谱系、置信度校准、执行闭环，还有延迟标签。","en":"The previous version could say this tray is contaminated. It could not say quarantine these three shelves, this batch, and this mother line. This version closes four gaps: lineage, calibration, actuation, and labels that arrive late."}},{"id":"04","minDur":12,"kicker":{"zh":"架构","en":"ARCHITECTURE"},"title":{"zh":"七层，一条快路径，一条慢路径","en":"Seven layers, one fast path, one slow path"},"say":{"zh":"最快的判断，从摄像头到阀门不到三百毫秒。最慢的结果，要等三十到四十五天才能结算。两件事节奏完全不同，所以底下用同一条只追加的账本，把它们串起来。","en":"The fastest decision goes from camera to valve in under three hundred milliseconds. The slowest result takes thirty to forty five days to settle. Two very different clocks, tied together by a single append-only ledger."}},{"id":"05","minDur":11,"kicker":{"zh":"决策地图","en":"DECISION MAP"},"title":{"zh":"十四个节点，三个不可逆的闸门","en":"Fourteen nodes, three irreversible gates"},"say":{"zh":"其中三道门不能反悔：驯化达标度、移栽、营养雾配方。驯化这道定松了，付代价的是雾培车间，不是组培室。","en":"Three of them you cannot undo: acclimation readiness, transplant, and the nutrient fog recipe. Set readiness too loose, and the aeroponics floor pays for it, not the lab."}},{"id":"06","minDur":15,"kicker":{"zh":"判断器实验室","en":"THE THRESHOLD"},"title":{"zh":"阈值不是拍出来的，是算出来的","en":"The threshold is argued from money, not taste"},"say":{"zh":"漏掉一盘污染，大约损失九百美元；误隔离一盘健康苗，只亏四十。纯算账，四%就该动手。可一线承受不了几乎全隔离，所以加一条运营下限，最后落在十五%。","en":"Missing one contaminated tray costs about nine hundred dollars. Quarantining a healthy one costs forty. Pure maths says act at four percent. But nobody can quarantine almost everything, so an operating floor lifts it to fifteen."}},{"id":"07","minDur":13,"kicker":{"zh":"接口与人","en":"CONTRACT AND HUMANS"},"title":{"zh":"一个接口，四种「我不判」","en":"One endpoint. Four ways to say I won't decide."},"say":{"zh":"数据不够、主动弃权、没有安全选项、交给人——这四种不决策，都是正式输出。每次调用都写进哈希链账本，检查问到当时为什么放行，导出来就是凭证。","en":"Missing data. Abstain. No safe option. Defer to a human. All four are legitimate outputs. Every call lands in a hash-chained ledger, so when an inspector asks why this batch was released, you export an answer."}},{"id":"08","minDur":12,"kicker":{"zh":"学习闭环","en":"THE LOOP"},"title":{"zh":"标签晚到，就把闭环做成异步的","en":"Labels arrive late, so the loop runs async"},"say":{"zh":"污染标签两周才到，移栽成活要六周。所以它不是实时学习，而是结算、校准、盯漂移、影子运行，最后三个条件都成立，才允许晋级。","en":"Contamination labels take two weeks. Survival takes six. So nothing here learns in real time. It settles, calibrates, watches for drift, runs in shadow, and only promotes when three conditions all hold."}},{"id":"09","minDur":12,"kicker":{"zh":"怎么证明","en":"PROOF"},"title":{"zh":"必须证明，不是宣称","en":"Proven, not asserted"},"say":{"zh":"污染率从八%降到四%，每组大约要五百五十盘。随机化的单位是架层，不是单盘——按盘随机，处理效应会漏进对照组。","en":"Going from eight percent contamination to four needs roughly five hundred and fifty trays per arm. Randomise by shelf, not by tray. Otherwise the treatment leaks into the control."}},{"id":"10","minDur":15,"kicker":{"zh":"经济性与结语","en":"DOES IT PAY BACK"},"title":{"zh":"最后一个问题：算得过来吗","en":"So does it pay back?"},"say":{"zh":"年出圃六万株，它永远回不了本，别自建，去用邻场的设备。到二十四万株，二十个月回本。它就像一个好同事：知道什么时候该说话，也知道什么时候该闭嘴。","en":"At sixty thousand plants a year it never pays back, so do not build your own, share a neighbour's. At two hundred and forty thousand, twenty months. Think of it as a good colleague: knows when to speak, and knows when to keep quiet."}}]},"zh":{"lang":"zh","fps":30,"total":176.064,"scenes":[{"id":"01","start":1.2,"dur":17.48,"audioStart":1.75,"audioDur":15.48},{"id":"02","start":18.68,"dur":16.736,"audioStart":19.23,"audioDur":14.736},{"id":"03","start":35.416,"dur":17.456,"audioStart":35.966,"audioDur":15.456},{"id":"04","start":52.872,"dur":18.584,"audioStart":53.422,"audioDur":16.584},{"id":"05","start":71.456,"dur":13.832,"audioStart":72.006,"audioDur":11.832},{"id":"06","start":85.288,"dur":20.36,"audioStart":85.838,"audioDur":18.36},{"id":"07","start":105.648,"dur":18.008,"audioStart":106.198,"audioDur":16.008},{"id":"08","start":123.656,"dur":16.832,"audioStart":124.206,"audioDur":14.832},{"id":"09","start":140.488,"dur":15.68,"audioStart":141.038,"audioDur":13.68},{"id":"10","start":156.168,"dur":17.696,"audioStart":156.718,"audioDur":15.696}],"audio":"audio/narration_zh.wav"},"en":{"lang":"en","fps":30,"total":181.224,"scenes":[{"id":"01","start":1.2,"dur":17.576,"audioStart":1.75,"audioDur":15.576},{"id":"02","start":18.776,"dur":17.24,"audioStart":19.326,"audioDur":15.24},{"id":"03","start":36.016,"dur":19.112,"audioStart":36.566,"audioDur":17.112},{"id":"04","start":55.128,"dur":17.12,"audioStart":55.678,"audioDur":15.12},{"id":"05","start":72.248,"dur":14.576,"audioStart":72.798,"audioDur":12.576},{"id":"06","start":86.824,"dur":19.544,"audioStart":87.374,"audioDur":17.544},{"id":"07","start":106.368,"dur":20.864,"audioStart":106.918,"audioDur":18.864},{"id":"08","start":127.232,"dur":18.872,"audioStart":127.782,"audioDur":16.872},{"id":"09","start":146.104,"dur":14.984,"audioStart":146.654,"audioDur":12.984},{"id":"10","start":161.088,"dur":17.936,"audioStart":161.638,"audioDur":15.936}],"audio":"audio/narration_en.wav"}};
